  "intro": "1. Valid US passport — expires 2028 ✓; one blank page minimum 2. Visit Japan Web QR codes — immigration + customs saved offline + printed (03-immigration-entry) 3. Travel insurance policy # + 24/7 emergency line — phone contact + printed wallet card (14-health-safety) 4. JR Pass 7-day exchange voucher — print + PDF; activate Jul 29 (07-transport-money) 5. Japan eSIM activated before departure — Airalo/Ubigi 15-day; QR saved in email (09-tech-connectivity) 6. Credit/debit cards + bank travel notification — 7-Eleven ATM compatible (no foreign fee card ideal) 7. Virtual or physical Suica/PASMO — loaded ¥3,000–5,000 before leaving airport 8. Prescription medications — 17-day supply in carry-on + doctor note in English 9. 20,000 mAh USB-C power bank — airline-compliant; essential for Fushimi dawn + Shirakawa-go bus day 10. Trail runners or broken-in walking shoes — Fushimi stairs + Kamakura cobblestones; not new shoes 11. Ultralight rain jacket — afternoon thunderstorms; Alps weather shifts fast 12. SPF 50 sunscreen + hat — non-negotiable for Jul/Aug; reapply every 2 hrs 13. Electrolyte tablets / ORS packets — heat days in Kyoto/Osaka 14. Compression packing cubes — enables takkyubin bag vs carry-on split Jul 28 15. Hotel confirmation printout — all addresses in Japanese + English for taxi/takkyubin labels",
